 "function": "estimateTokens",
 "note": "Each case names its function in fn. estimateTokens and shortTokens are in src/estimate.ts. noteClasses and needTokens are in src/accuracy.ts. parseSize, parseWindows, fitIn and percent are in src/budget.ts. A name that starts with a number is the acceptance case of BRIEF.md that it checks.",
 "cases": [
  {
